{"product_id":"flow-earbuds","title":"Flow Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds are built for seamless audio, everyday comfort, and effortless connectivity. Designed for modern lifestyles, they deliver powerful sound, smart controls, and all-day convenience in a compact form.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1sboupi\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"17djwzr\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"462\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"410\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Crisp audio with deep bass and balanced clarity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f21ur0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"548\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eNoise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reduces background noise for better focus and clearer calls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hwist3\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"632\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eBluetooth Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast, stable, and instant pairing with all devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1h7h2r3\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"711\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Control music, calls, and functions with a simple tap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"f7ntnc\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"784\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\"\u003eBuilt-in Microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e – Clear voice quality for calls and meetings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1sz22y3\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"854\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"809\"\u003eSingle \u0026amp; Dual Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Use one or both earbuds as per your need\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"g5zfhw\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"929\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"874\"\u003eErgonomic Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Comfortable and secure for long listening sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jsvptw\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"958\"\u003eSweat-Resistant Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Perfect for workouts and daily use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1v9qucm\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1062\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003ePortable Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy charging anytime, anywhere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"11djg2n\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended usage with charging case backup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1hz4s1p\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1162\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"9741mt\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; lightweight design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kbxqf4\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eAuto-connect after first pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ttuwac\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1290\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iOS \u0026amp; all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"zb1b6u\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003eCharging cable included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ugwij\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003eEasy to use interface\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1472\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds combine performance, comfort, and convenience — making them the perfect everyday audio companion.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title"